@title 3D vents, final walk: hot run, the proposal card, add by card, save under a new name, reopen, run again
@area 3D
@sizes 1280x688 1366x768 1920x1080
# The whole vent workflow on the hot cabinet: a Quick run shows T1 over its limit, the Cooling selection proposes a filter fan and the Vents and fans card offers it with the exhaust grille that lets the air through; one press adds both, the project is saved under a new name and reopened, the openings are still there, and a second run draws them and the air.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 45
shot 01-hot-result
check_layout
check_blank 01-hot-result
expect "Cooling selection"
expect "Cooling selection proposes"
expect "A grille of about"
click_text "Add the filter fan and a grille to the cabinet"
wait 10
expect "Already added"
expect "Grille, in the right wall"
# Auto is on: adding the openings starts a new run (the list stays editable while it goes).
shot 02-fan-and-grille-added-run-started
wait_s 150
expect_not "No air moves"
shot 03-fan-and-grille-result
check_layout
check_blank 03-fan-and-grille-result
answer_dialog ~/Documents/KoperCAD/vents-final-walk.kopercad
key ctrl+shift+s
wait 20
expect_file ~/Documents/KoperCAD/vents-final-walk.kopercad 4000
open ~/Documents/KoperCAD/vents-final-walk.kopercad
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
expect "Filter fan"
expect "Grille, in the right wall"
shot 05-reopened
check_layout
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 45
shot 06-second-run
check_layout
check_blank 06-second-run
